        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2441] If the revocation status of any certificate in vehicle certificate chain is not available or cannot be determined, per [V2G20-2433], the private SECC not supporting PnC can continue validation of the received vehicle certificate chain.",
